OL,3,GNEWSATfL needs more powers on
OL,4,Adriverless taxis - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FDriverless taxis could worsen
OL,7,Fcongestion and threaten jobs, a report
OL,8,Fhas warned, as it called for Transport
OL,9,Ffor London (TfL) to be given greater
OL,10,Fpowers to regulate the emerging
OL,11,Findustry.
OL,13,FThe London Assembly transport committee
OL,14,Freport said it had not heard enough
OL,15,Fevidence to be convinced the capital
OL,16,Fshould welcome driverless cars.
OL,18,FA committee-commissioned YouGov survey
OL,19,Ffound 42% of 1,053 Londoners opposed
OL,20,Fdriverless vehicles, while 29%
OL,21,Fsupported them and 29% would be likely
OL,22,Fto use one.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
