OL,3,GNEWSATfL needs more powers on
OL,4,Adriverless taxis - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Transport (DfT) said
OL,7,Fsafety was its priority and that
OL,8,Fself-driving vehicles would be
OL,9,Fintroduced carefully, and subject to
OL,10,Frigorous testing and regulatory
OL,11,Fapproval.
